+# Optional Elf Priest loot routes
+
+Port the proven Human Priest loot-path change from
+`vltrifonov/nethackers-bots@ffe67f7dba206f4aa0fdf2d52414b6c5eec44dec` to this
+leader’s active engine. Optional item checks route around occupied squares and
+yield if a monster blocks the route before the next step.
+
 # zLeadersSeed407717 (Claude, 2026-10-26)
 
 Identity router. Default base/ = github.com/daglar-dragomirov/nethacker@eab9a9c4f4e09bce096d5762e895fec51b63784d (unmodified).
